msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you have a single connector on your classpath, you can omit the "
"`connector` attribute configuration.\n"
"Quarkus automatically associates _orphan_ channels to the (unique) connector "
"found on the classpath.\n"
"_Orphan_ channels are outgoing channels without a downstream consumer or "
"incoming channels without an upstream producer."
msgstr ""

msgid "This auto-attachment can be disabled using:"
msgstr ""

msgid "For more configuration options see <<configuring-pulsar-clients>>."
