"In Shared subscription type, the broker **first dispatches messages to the "
"max priority level consumers if they have permits**. Otherwise, the broker "
"considers next priority level consumers. +\n"
"**Example 1** +\n"
"If a subscription has consumerA with `priorityLevel` 0 and consumerB with "
"`priorityLevel` 1, then the broker **only dispatches messages to consumerA "
"until it runs out permits** and then starts dispatching messages to "
"consumerB. +\n"
"**Example 2** +\n"
"Consumer Priority, Level, Permits +\n"
"C1, 0, 2 +\n"
"C2, 0, 1 +\n"
"C3, 0, 1 +\n"
"C4, 1, 2 +\n"
